### Water

Water is one of the `main components` of food and is essential for human life. The human body `cannot` maintain its `structure or physiological functions` without it:
:::

:::.col-4 .col-md-2
![img](https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRvKO2wI9z7JH0YG_I_AHCjPeFyrV71_QPWSWIcNNWxXGCNcpepL0ocFz0&amp;s=10)
:::
:::
